---
title: "team_set_leader (Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: check authenticated session
    q_auth --> q_error_unauth: session invalid
    q_auth --> q_check_admin: session valid
    q_check_admin --> q_error_forbidden: user is not admin
    q_check_admin --> q_validate: user is admin
    q_validate --> q_check_membership: validate member belongs to team
    q_check_membership --> q_error_not_member: member not in team
    q_check_membership --> q_set_leader: member is in team
    q_set_leader --> [*]: update team leader via SQL, return success
    q_error_unauth --> [*]: return unauthorized error
    q_error_forbidden --> [*]: return forbidden error
    q_error_not_member --> [*]: return error member not in team

    note right of q_check_membership
        INV-001: Team leader must be a current member of the team
        INV-002: Only admin users can designate team leaders
    end note
